# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Agent-facing documentation and settings — local only, never version controlled.
#
# AGENTS.md is the entry point (CLAUDE.md just imports it); .dev-notes/ holds
# the architecture and design docs it points to. .claude/settings.local.json
# blocks agent git mutations.
#
# NOTE: `git rm --cached` was run on AGENTS.md / CLAUDE.md / memory/ to untrack
# them. That stops future commits but does NOT purge them from existing history
# on the remote — older commits still expose them. Rewriting history would
# require git filter-repo + a force push.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
#AGENTS.md
#CLAUDE.md
#.dev-notes/
memory/
.claude/settings.local.json